{"sourceUrl":"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/2025/0508/c69701a3047183/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:56.399506+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/2025/0508/c69701a3047183/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>为加强浙江大学物理学院与国内高水平大学相关院系的交流和联系，使更多的学生能够进一步认识浙大、了解浙大，定于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>27</span><span>日</span><span>-29</span><span>日举办“优秀大学生夏令营”。本次夏令营将给优秀大学生提供一个学术互动和交流学习的平台，期间将安排营员参观校园和物理学院、聆听科研讲座、与导师和优秀研究生面对面交流、优秀营员评选等活动。</span></p><p><span>本次夏令营面向全国高校招收营员</span><span>120</span><span>名，相关的安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>一、</span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span>物理及相关专业本科三年级在校学生（</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月毕业）；</span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>学习成绩优秀，英语基础扎实（</span><span>大学英语六级</span><span>460</span><span>分及以上，或雅思</span><span>5.5</span><span>分及以上，或托福</span><span>80</span><span>分及以上优先考虑</span><span>），对物理专业有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的或潜在的研究能力；</span></p><p><span>3. </span><span>遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><strong><span>资助</span></strong></p><p><span>夏令营不收注册费。入营期间餐费、往返车票费用、住宿费自理（营员可保留相关票据，待<span>9</span>月份拟录取后可按浙大相关规定报销路费、住宿费。报销标准、发票开具要求等另行通知）。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>三、申请方式</span></strong></p><p><span>夏令营采用网上报名方式。</span><span>即日起至</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>5</span><span>月</span><span>29</span><span>日登录浙江大学研究生招生处夏令营报名系统</span><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</span><span>进行报名。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>四、审核及录取</span></strong></p><p><span>物理学院组织相关老师负责营员的审核和选拔，择优录取。营员名单将于</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日左右在物理学院网公布（</span><span>http://physics.zju.edu.cn/</span><span>）并通过报名系统发布。被录取的同学需在</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日前在系统中确认是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃资格。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>五、报名材料</span></strong></p><p><span>系统报名时需上传：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>       </span><span>近期正面免冠彩色证件照，电子版</span><span>JPG</span><span>格式。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>       </span><span>本科阶段成绩单（需加盖教务处或院系公章），</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>       </span><span>年级排名证明（需加盖院系公章），</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>       </span><span>外语水平证明（</span><span>CET6</span><span>、托福、雅思等），</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式。</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>       </span><span>获奖证书、发表论文等其他相关证明材料，</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式。</span></p><p><span>   </span></p><p><span>被录取的营员需在报到时提交以下纸质材料：</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>报名表（网上报名后，系统自动生成）。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>本科阶段成绩单（需加盖教务处或院系公章），原件。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>．</span><span>年级排名证明（需加盖院系公章），原件。</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>．</span><span>外语水平证明（</span><span>CET6</span><span>、托福、雅思等），复印件。</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>．</span><span>获奖证书、发表论文等其他相关证明材料，复印件。</span></p><p><span>6</span><span>．</span><span>2</span><span>封相关专业正高级职称专家签名的<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/7e/a0/0aa0ff9d45fa8dce9aefcbdf5e8a/777505dc-2431-42b7-aa24-39afdd20c61c.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专家推荐书.docx</a></span><span>(</span><span>请专家填写并签字后用信封封住，同时在封口处签名）。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>六、其他说明</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>参加夏令营的学生必须遵守浙江大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排进行工作和活动，擅自行动将取消营员资格。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/2025/0508/c69701a3047183/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>申请者可登录官网查看导师个人主页。：</span></a></p><p><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>物理学院：</span></span></span><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/ysjs/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://physics.zju.edu.cn/ysjs/list.htm</span></span></span></a><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>物理高等研究院：</span></span></span><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/szll_84464/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://physics.zju.edu.cn/szll_84464/list.htm</span></span></span></a><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>欢迎同学们提前与意向导师联系，充分沟通交流。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span></span><span></span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>七、咨询方式：</span></strong></p><p><span>电话：</span><span>0571-87953304</span><span>；</span><span> </span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>phyzll@zju.edu.cn</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学物理学院</span></p><p><span>                  2025</span><span>年</span><span>5</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"6ae8cfacd667fcdc981e17e463028ef5b53640bd17bfe407df3d607d481a6453","textLength":1239,"sourceSha256":"90ecc4d8bbf0ae99b02e49d5de6a52ab9ae20a26632a27e0f99831ead623ad8f","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b57f87807cad61dd533d","title":"2025年浙江大学物理学院优秀大学生夏令营的报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:56.399506+00:00"}
